# THE VERTICAL LINE (mechanics improvement 5b; AbilityGrapple.vertical). At the
# foot of a face with something solid standing at its top -- a post, a pylon, a
# bolt -- the magnet line goes straight up to that hold and hauls the body up
# the face and over the lip. The face is the nearest one `find_vertical` names,
# never a coordinate. From above, then over the shoulder.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/vertical_grapple.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=boots_magnet
coast calm
zoom 7
wait 0.6
ledge haul
wait 0.6
shot 01-at-the-foot-a-post-at-the-top
tap ability_grapple
await hauled 2
wait 0.3
shot 02-the-line-goes-up-to-the-post with hauled
wait 1.6
shot 03-over-the-lip-by-the-post

coast calm
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
ledge haul
wait 0.6
tap ability_grapple
await hauled 2
wait 0.3
shot 04-over-the-shoulder-hauled-up-the-face with shoulder,hauled
